						<div class="description">
							<div>
								
									<a href="/blog/how-to-tell-a-brand-story-in-30-seconds-helping-avaaz-fight-for-campaign-finance-reform">
										<h2 class="title">How to Tell a Brand Story in 30 Seconds: Helping Avaaz Fight for Campaign Finance Reform</h2>
									</a>
								
